  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sword-lesson",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The blade first. It's the most honest of the three arts: to hit them, you have to be close enough to be hit back.",
      "next": "sword-l2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "giveItem",
          "item": "oathbound-shortsword",
          "qty": 1
        }
      ],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-l2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Take this. Equip it from your bag, then open your Brawler skills and drag the first one onto your bar. Hold the key to aim, let go to strike.",
      "next": "sword-l3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-l3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Mouse Meadow is just east of the circle. Six of them. Get close, strike, and step out of the way before they bite. Watch the red on the ground: that's where they're about to hit.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-p",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Six mice, Mouse Meadow, east of the circle. Close, strike, step away. Red on the ground means move.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-done",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Not bad. You flinch less than most, and you didn't lose any fingers.",
      "next": "sword-d1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-d2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "But some things you won't want to get close to. Ready for the second art?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Teach me the bow.",
          "next": "sword-d3",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "path-of-the-arrow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I need a moment.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-d3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Good. Listen closely.",
      "next": "arrow-lesson",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "path-of-the-arrow-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The bow is next. Ready?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Ready.",
          "next": "path-of-the-arrow-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "path-of-the-arrow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "path-of-the-arrow-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Then listen closely.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-lesson",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "An archer wins the fight before it starts. Keep your distance, and never let them close it.",
      "next": "arrow-l2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "giveItem",
          "item": "pilgrim-shortbow",
          "qty": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "giveItem",
          "item": "wooden-arrows",
          "qty": 30
        }
      ],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-l2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Bow, arrows. Same as before: equip it, put a Ranger skill on your bar. Aim where they're going, not where they are.",
      "next": "arrow-l3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-p",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Six rats, the Warren, north-west. Make them come to you.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-done",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You've got a steady hand. That's rarer than courage, and it lasts longer.",
      "next": "arrow-d1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-d2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "There's one more art. The strangest of the three.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Show me.",
          "next": "arrow-d3",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "path-of-the-light"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Later.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-d3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Then let's see if you can hold light in your hands.",
      "next": "light-lesson",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "path-of-the-light-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The last art. Magic. Are you ready?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'm ready.",
          "next": "path-of-the-light-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "path-of-the-light"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "path-of-the-light-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Good.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "light-lesson",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Magic. They'll tell you it's the Benefactor's gift. Light given shape.",
      "next": "light-l2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "giveItem",
          "item": "acolyte-wand",
          "qty": 1
        }
      ],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "light-l2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Maybe it is. I've used it for longer than you've been alive, and I still couldn't tell you where it comes from.",
      "next": "light-l3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "light-l3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Aim it like an arrow, release it like a breath. Mage skills, on your bar. Try it on the wild pigs in Pig Hollow, south-west of the circle. They're sturdier than they look.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "light-p",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Four pigs, Pig Hollow, south-west. Light. Breathe.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "light-done",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Blade, bow and light. Most people pick one and spend their whole lives on it. You've held all three.",
      "next": "light-d1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2800,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "light-d2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You'll learn the rest by walking the world. Go and see Archivist Maelis at the Archive in town. He'll explain it better than I can, and at much greater length.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2800,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "falcons-secret-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Maelis talked your ear off? Good. Then you've learned everything this side of the island can teach you.",
      "next": "falcons-secret-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "falcons-secret-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Meet me at the lookout, at the far end of the mountain path above town. Alone. There's something I want to tell you where nobody else can hear.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll be there.",
          "next": "falcons-secret-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "falcons-secret"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "falcons-secret-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Don't tell anyone where you're going. I'll head up now.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ft-hello",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The Training Grounds. Blade, bow or light: pick your poison.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3360,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sword-d1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Here. Armour, and a buckler for the off hand. A blade-fighter lives or dies by what they can take.",
      "next": "sword-d2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-l3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The Rat Warren is north-west of the circle, up by the fence. Six rats. They're quick, so make them come to you.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-d1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "A jerkin and a quiver. Light enough to keep running in.",
      "next": "arrow-d2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "light-d1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Robe and hood. They won't stop a blade, but the light runs easier through them.",
      "next": "gift-0",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gift-0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "And one more thing. Every student who finishes the three paths gets something from my own collection. Only one, so choose the art that felt like yours.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "The Talon. I'll stay close.",
          "next": "gift-sword",
          "when": [
            {
              "kind": "flag",
              "flag": "falcon-gift",
              "set": false
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "giveItem",
              "item": "falcons-talon",
              "qty": 1
            },
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "flag": "falcon-gift",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Windcutter. I'd rather they never reach me.",
          "next": "gift-bow",
          "when": [
            {
              "kind": "flag",
              "flag": "falcon-gift",
              "set": false
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "giveItem",
              "item": "windcutter",
              "qty": 1
            },
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "flag": "falcon-gift",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Skylight Staff. I want to understand the light.",
          "next": "gift-staff",
          "when": [
            {
              "kind": "flag",
              "flag": "falcon-gift",
              "set": false
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "giveItem",
              "item": "skylight-staff",
              "qty": 1
            },
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "flag": "falcon-gift",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gift-sword",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The Talon. It was my first blade. Don't make me regret it.",
      "next": "light-d2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gift-bow",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Windcutter. It always did like flying more than I did.",
      "next": "light-d2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gift-staff",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The Skylight Staff. Careful. It listens.",
      "next": "light-d2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gift-again",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Before you go: you never chose your gift.",
      "next": "gift-0",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ft-wait",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Go and see Maelis at the Archive. I'm not going anywhere.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    }
  ],
  "looksLike": "falcon"
}